# An entry that leaves the memory log while a save of its is queued: a link's entry is replaced by the first status
# change of its alert in the same pass, saved by HEALTH with that change, and trimmed at the pass's end; the store
# job still saves it, as it stands by then, and only then is it freed. Then a host whose alerts are all deleted
# (the prototypes applied anew) with saves queued.
rules tests/corpus/queue/queue.conf
saved 1
queue 1
chart loop.q loop.q_name loop.queue - things 1
dim loop.q value value 7
var loop.q v 10
lookup loop.q 200 10 0
clock 0
pass 0
clock 1
store
clock 2
pass 2
var loop.q v 70
lookup loop.q 200 70 0
clock 3
pass 3
clock 4
apply
clock 5
store
clock 6
pass 6
clock 7
store
clock 8
pass 8
